 "widget": "<div class=\"tcf-page tcf-scope tcf-p-how-we-compare-providers\"><div id=\"tcf-how-we-compare-providers-root\" class=\"tcf-root\">@@SSR@@</div></div>\n<template id=\"tcf-how-we-compare-providers-tpl\">\n\n\n<div data-screen-label=\"How We Compare Providers\" class=\"tcf-screen\">\n  \n\n  <div class=\"tcf-hero-fixed\" style=\"position:relative;overflow:hidden;color:#fff;padding:110px 56px 100px\">\n    <img src=\"@@MEDIA:photos/comparing-ctec-courses.webp@@\" alt=\"\" class=\"tcf-hero-bg\" style=\"position:absolute;inset:0;width:100%;height:100%;object-fit:cover\"><div style=\"position:absolute;inset:0;background:linear-gradient(100deg,rgba(11,46,64,.96) 0%,rgba(11,46,64,.88) 55%,rgba(11,46,64,.78) 100%)\"></div>\n      <div style=\"position:absolute;inset:0;background-image:linear-gradient(135deg,rgba(255,255,255,.07) 0%,rgba(255,255,255,0) 55%);\"></div>\n    <div style=\"position:relative;max-width:1200px;margin:0 auto\"><div style=\"display:flex;flex-direction:column;gap:20px;max-width:820px\">\n      <span style=\"align-self:flex-start;border:1px solid rgba(108,190,69,.5);color:#95AB3B;border-radius:999px;padding:7px 14px;font:700 17px Manrope,sans-serif;letter-spacing:.1em;text-transform:uppercase\">Our method</span>\n      <h1 style=\"margin:0;font:300 52px/1.05 'Source Serif 4',Georgia,serif;\"><span style=\"display:block\">How we</span><span style=\"display:block;font-weight:300\">compare <span style=\"color:#95AB3B\">providers</span></span></h1>\n      <p style=\"margin:0;font-size:22px;line-height:1.55;color:#fff;max-width:640px;text-wrap:pretty\">Tax Course Finder lists every CTEC-approved education provider and shows the same facts for each. We do not score, rank or recommend schools. The order you see is the sort you choose.</p>\n    </div></div>\n  </div>\n  <div style=\"height:6px;background:linear-gradient(90deg,#95AB3B,#7E9330)\"></div>\n  <div style=\"background:#F4F6F7;padding:72px 56px\">\n    <div style=\"max-width:1200px;margin:0 auto;display:flex;flex-direction:column;gap:28px\">\n      <div style=\"max-width:820px\"><div style=\"font:700 17px Manrope,sans-serif;letter-spacing:.12em;text-transform:uppercase;color:#7E9330\">What is on every listing</div><h2 style=\"margin:10px 0 0;font:300 52px/1.1 'Source Serif 4',Georgia,serif;\">The same facts, <span style=\"font-weight:300\">the same way</span></h2><p style=\"margin:0;font-size:22px;line-height:1.65;color:#2F4652;text-wrap:pretty;margin-top:14px\">Each provider row shows the details below when we have verified them. A blank field means we have not confirmed it yet; it does not mean the provider lacks the feature.</p></div>\n      <style>.tcf-fact{transition:transform .18s ease,box-shadow .18s ease,border-color .18s ease}.tcf-fact::before{content:\"\";position:absolute;left:0;top:0;right:0;height:3px;background:#95AB3B;transform:scaleX(0);transform-origin:left;transition:transform .25s ease}.tcf-fact:hover{transform:translateY(-3px);box-shadow:0 18px 40px rgba(11,46,64,.10);border-color:#C9D58F!important}.tcf-fact:hover::before{transform:scaleX(1)}</style><div style=\"display:grid;grid-template-columns:1fr 1fr 1fr;gap:18px\"><div class=\"tcf-fact\" style=\"position:relative;background:#fff;border:1px solid #D7DFE2;border-radius:18px;padding:28px 28px 24px;display:flex;flex-direction:column;gap:14px;overflow:hidden\"><div style=\"display:flex;align-items:center;justify-content:space-between;gap:12px\"><div style=\"width:52px;height:52px;border-radius:14px;background:#F3F5E6;display:grid;place-items:center;flex:none\"><svg width=\"26\" height=\"26\" viewBox=\"0 0 24 24\" fill=\"none\" stroke=\"#7E9330\" stroke-width=\"1.9\" stroke-linecap=\"round\" stroke-linejoin=\"round\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><path d=\"M12 3l8 3v6c0 5-3.5 8-8 9-4.5-1-8-4-8-9V6l8-3z\"></path><path d=\"m9 12 2 2 4-4\"></path></svg></div><span style=\"font:700 13px Manrope,sans-serif;letter-spacing:.12em;color:#B5BECB\">01</span></div><h3 style=\"margin:4px 0 0;font:800 22px Manrope,sans-serif;color:#0B2E40\">CTEC approval</h3><p style=\"margin:0;font-size:19px;line-height:1.6;color:#2F4652;flex:1\">Every school is matched to CTEC&#8217;s approved-provider registry before it appears, with the course types (20-hour CE, 60-hour QE) its approval covers.</p><div style=\"margin-top:6px;padding-top:16px;border-top:1px dashed #D7DFE2;display:flex;flex-direction:column;gap:10px\"><span style=\"font:700 12px Manrope,sans-serif;letter-spacing:.1em;text-transform:uppercase;color:#8A9AA3\">On the listing</span><div style=\"display:flex;flex-wrap:wrap;align-items:center;gap:8px 10px\"><span style=\"font:700 16px Manrope,sans-serif;color:#0B2E40\">CE &#183; QE</span><span style=\"font:700 12px Manrope,sans-serif;letter-spacing:.1em;text-transform:uppercase;color:#8A9AA3\">CTEC approved</span></div></div></div><div class=\"tcf-fact\" style=\"position:relative;background:#fff;border:1px solid #D7DFE2;border-radius:18px;padding:28px 28px 24px;display:flex;flex-direction:column;gap:14px;overflow:hidden\"><div style=\"display:flex;align-items:center;justify-content:space-between;gap:12px\"><div style=\"width:52px;height:52px;border-radius:14px;background:#F3F5E6;display:grid;place-items:center;flex:none\"><svg width=\"26\" height=\"26\" viewBox=\"0 0 24 24\" fill=\"none\" stroke=\"#7E9330\" stroke-width=\"1.9\" stroke-linecap=\"round\" stroke-linejoin=\"round\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><path d=\"M3 12V4a1 1 0 0 1 1-1h8l9 9-9 9-9-9z\"></path><circle cx=\"7.5\" cy=\"7.5\" r=\"1.5\"></circle></svg></div><span style=\"font:700 13px Manrope,sans-serif;letter-spacing:.12em;color:#B5BECB\">02</span></div><h3 style=\"margin:4px 0 0;font:800 22px Manrope,sans-serif;color:#0B2E40\">Course bundle price</h3><p style=\"margin:0;font-size:19px;line-height:1.6;color:#2F4652;flex:1\">The price on the provider&#8217;s own website for the complete course. If a school publishes no flat price, the row says so instead of estimating.</p><div style=\"margin-top:6px;padding-top:16px;border-top:1px dashed #D7DFE2;display:flex;flex-direction:column;gap:10px\"><span style=\"font:700 12px Manrope,sans-serif;letter-spacing:.1em;text-transform:uppercase;color:#8A9AA3\">On the listing</span><div style=\"display:flex;flex-wrap:wrap;align-items:center;gap:8px 10px\"><span style=\"font:700 20px Manrope,sans-serif;color:#0B2E40;font-variant-numeric:tabular-nums\">$49.95</span><span style=\"font:700 12px Manrope,sans-serif;letter-spacing:.1em;text-transform:uppercase;color:#8A9AA3\">Course bundle price</span></div></div></div><div class=\"tcf-fact\" style=\"position:relative;background:#fff;border:1px solid #D7DFE2;border-radius:18px;padding:28px 28px 24px;display:flex;flex-direction:column;gap:14px;overflow:hidden\"><div style=\"display:flex;align-items:center;justify-content:space-between;gap:12px\"><div style=\"width:52px;height:52px;border-radius:14px;background:#F3F5E6;display:grid;place-items:center;flex:none\"><svg width=\"26\" height=\"26\" viewBox=\"0 0 24 24\" fill=\"none\" stroke=\"#7E9330\" stroke-width=\"1.9\" stroke-linecap=\"round\" stroke-linejoin=\"round\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><path d=\"M19 5 5 19\"></path><circle cx=\"7\" cy=\"7\" r=\"2.5\"></circle><circle cx=\"17\" cy=\"17\" r=\"2.5\"></circle></svg></div><span style=\"font:700 13px Manrope,sans-serif;letter-spacing:.12em;color:#B5BECB\">03</span></div><h3 style=\"margin:4px 0 0;font:800 22px Manrope,sans-serif;color:#0B2E40\">Current offers</h3><p style=\"margin:0;font-size:19px;line-height:1.6;color:#2F4652;flex:1\">Coupon codes and sales are recorded only when found on the provider&#8217;s site or supplied by the provider, with the date checked. Expired offers are removed.</p><div style=\"margin-top:6px;padding-top:16px;border-top:1px dashed #D7DFE2;display:flex;flex-direction:column;gap:10px\"><span style=\"font:700 12px Manrope,sans-serif;letter-spacing:.1em;text-transform:uppercase;color:#8A9AA3\">On the listing</span><div style=\"display:flex;flex-wrap:wrap;align-items:center;gap:8px 10px\"><span style=\"font:700 15px ui-monospace,Menlo,monospace;color:#7E9330;background:#F3F5E6;border:1.5px dashed #95AB3B;border-radius:6px;padding:4px 9px\">SAVE10</span><span style=\"font:700 12px Manrope,sans-serif;letter-spacing:.1em;text-transform:uppercase;color:#8A9AA3\">Coupon code</span></div></div></div><div class=\"tcf-fact\" style=\"position:relative;background:#fff;border:1px solid #D7DFE2;border-radius:18px;padding:28px 28px 24px;display:flex;flex-direction:column;gap:14px;overflow:hidden\"><div style=\"display:flex;align-items:center;justify-content:space-between;gap:12px\"><div style=\"width:52px;height:52px;border-radius:14px;background:#F3F5E6;display:grid;place-items:center;flex:none\"><svg width=\"26\" height=\"26\" viewBox=\"0 0 24 24\" fill=\"none\" stroke=\"#7E9330\" stroke-width=\"1.9\" stroke-linecap=\"round\" stroke-linejoin=\"round\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><rect x=\"3\" y=\"4\" width=\"18\" height=\"12\" rx=\"2\"></rect><path d=\"M8 20h8M12 16v4\"></path><path d=\"m10.5 8 3.5 2-3.5 2z\"></path></svg></div><span style=\"font:700 13px Manrope,sans-serif;letter-spacing:.12em;color:#B5BECB\">04</span></div><h3 style=\"margin:4px 0 0;font:800 22px Manrope,sans-serif;color:#0B2E40\">Course format</h3><p style=\"margin:0;font-size:19px;line-height:1.6;color:#2F4652;flex:1\">Online, in-person and live classes, plus printed books, PDFs and online videos, shown once confirmed by the provider or our review.</p><div style=\"margin-top:6px;padding-top:16px;border-top:1px dashed #D7DFE2;display:flex;flex-direction:column;gap:10px\"><span style=\"font:700 12px Manrope,sans-serif;letter-spacing:.1em;text-transform:uppercase;color:#8A9AA3\">On the listing</span><div style=\"display:flex;flex-wrap:wrap;align-items:center;gap:8px 10px\"><span style=\"font:600 14px/1 Manrope,sans-serif;padding:6px 11px;border-radius:999px;border:1px solid #D7DFE2;background:#fff;color:#2F4652;white-space:nowrap\">Online</span><span style=\"font:600 14px/1 Manrope,sans-serif;padding:6px 11px;border-radius:999px;border:1px solid #D7DFE2;background:#fff;color:#2F4652;white-space:nowrap\">PDF</span><span style=\"font:600 14px/1 Manrope,sans-serif;padding:6px 11px;border-radius:999px;border:1px solid #D7DFE2;background:#fff;color:#2F4652;white-space:nowrap\">Online videos</span></div></div></div><div class=\"tcf-fact\" style=\"position:relative;background:#fff;border:1px solid #D7DFE2;border-radius:18px;padding:28px 28px 24px;display:flex;flex-direction:column;gap:14px;overflow:hidden\"><div style=\"display:flex;align-items:center;justify-content:space-between;gap:12px\"><div style=\"width:52px;height:52px;border-radius:14px;background:#F3F5E6;display:grid;place-items:center;flex:none\"><svg width=\"26\" height=\"26\" viewBox=\"0 0 24 24\" fill=\"none\" stroke=\"#7E9330\" stroke-width=\"1.9\" stroke-linecap=\"round\" stroke-linejoin=\"round\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><path d=\"M4 14v-2a8 8 0 0 1 16 0v2\"></path><rect x=\"3\" y=\"14\" width=\"4\" height=\"6\" rx=\"1.5\"></rect><rect x=\"17\" y=\"14\" width=\"4\" height=\"6\" rx=\"1.5\"></rect></svg></div><span style=\"font:700 13px Manrope,sans-serif;letter-spacing:.12em;color:#B5BECB\">05</span></div><h3 style=\"margin:4px 0 0;font:800 22px Manrope,sans-serif;color:#0B2E40\">Student support</h3><p style=\"margin:0;font-size:19px;line-height:1.6;color:#2F4652;flex:1\">Phone, email and live chat support, shown only when verified, so you know how to get help before you enroll.</p><div style=\"margin-top:6px;padding-top:16px;border-top:1px dashed #D7DFE2;display:flex;flex-direction:column;gap:10px\"><span style=\"font:700 12px Manrope,sans-serif;letter-spacing:.1em;text-transform:uppercase;color:#8A9AA3\">On the listing</span><div style=\"display:flex;flex-wrap:wrap;align-items:center;gap:8px 10px\"><span style=\"font:600 14px/1 Manrope,sans-serif;padding:6px 11px;border-radius:999px;border:1px solid #D7DFE2;background:#fff;color:#2F4652;white-space:nowrap\">Phone support</span><span style=\"font:600 14px/1 Manrope,sans-serif;padding:6px 11px;border-radius:999px;border:1px solid #D7DFE2;background:#fff;color:#2F4652;white-space:nowrap\">Email support</span><span style=\"font:600 14px/1 Manrope,sans-serif;padding:6px 11px;border-radius:999px;border:1px solid #D7DFE2;background:#fff;color:#2F4652;white-space:nowrap\">Live chat</span></div></div></div><div class=\"tcf-fact\" style=\"position:relative;background:#fff;border:1px solid #D7DFE2;border-radius:18px;padding:28px 28px 24px;display:flex;flex-direction:column;gap:14px;overflow:hidden\"><div style=\"display:flex;align-items:center;justify-content:space-between;gap:12px\"><div style=\"width:52px;height:52px;border-radius:14px;background:#F3F5E6;display:grid;place-items:center;flex:none\"><svg width=\"26\" height=\"26\" viewBox=\"0 0 24 24\" fill=\"none\" stroke=\"#7E9330\" stroke-width=\"1.9\" stroke-linecap=\"round\" stroke-linejoin=\"round\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><path d=\"M14 4h6v6\"></path><path d=\"M20 4 11 13\"></path><path d=\"M19 14v5a1 1 0 0 1-1 1H5a1 1 0 0 1-1-1V6a1 1 0 0 1 1-1h5\"></path></svg></div><span style=\"font:700 13px Manrope,sans-serif;letter-spacing:.12em;color:#B5BECB\">06</span></div><h3 style=\"margin:4px 0 0;font:800 22px Manrope,sans-serif;color:#0B2E40\">Website link</h3><p style=\"margin:0;font-size:19px;line-height:1.6;color:#2F4652;flex:1\">A direct link to the provider&#8217;s course page. You enroll with the school, not with us.</p><div style=\"margin-top:6px;padding-top:16px;border-top:1px dashed #D7DFE2;display:flex;flex-direction:column;gap:10px\"><span style=\"font:700 12px Manrope,sans-serif;letter-spacing:.1em;text-transform:uppercase;color:#8A9AA3\">On the listing</span><div style=\"display:flex;flex-wrap:wrap;align-items:center;gap:8px 10px\"><span style=\"display:inline-flex;align-items:center;gap:6px;font:700 15px Manrope,sans-serif;background:#95AB3B;color:#fff;border-radius:999px;padding:8px 16px\">View course<svg width=\"13\" height=\"13\" viewBox=\"0 0 24 24\" fill=\"none\" stroke=\"currentColor\" stroke-width=\"2.8\" stroke-linecap=\"round\" stroke-linejoin=\"round\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><path d=\"M5 12h14\"></path><path d=\"m13 6 6 6-6 6\"></path></svg></span></div></div></div></div>\n    </div>\n  </div>\n  <div class=\"tcf-cta\" style=\"background:#0B2E40;padding:64px 56px;color:#fff\"><div style=\"max-width:1200px;margin:0 auto;display:flex;flex-wrap:wrap;align-items:center;justify-content:space-between;gap:28px 48px\"><div style=\"flex:1 1 520px;display:flex;flex-direction:column;gap:12px\"><div style=\"display:flex;align-items:center;gap:12px;font:700 17px Manrope,sans-serif;letter-spacing:.14em;text-transform:uppercase;color:#AEC25A\"><span style=\"width:28px;height:2px;background:#95AB3B\"></span>Find your course</div><h2 style=\"margin:0;font:300 44px/1.1 'Source Serif 4',Georgia,serif;text-wrap:balance\">Search our directory of CTEC-approved schools</h2><p style=\"margin:0;font-size:20px;line-height:1.6;color:rgba(255,255,255,.78);max-width:640px\">See every provider side by side: prices, current coupons, course format and support. Then go straight to the school&#8217;s course page.</p></div><div style=\"display:flex;flex-wrap:wrap;gap:12px;flex:0 1 auto\"><a href=\"/#find-schools\" style=\"display:inline-flex;align-items:center;justify-content:center;gap:8px;font:700 19px Manrope,sans-serif;border-radius:999px;white-space:nowrap;text-decoration:none;cursor:pointer;transition:background .15s,border-color .15s,color .15s;line-height:1.2;padding:14px 28px;background:#95AB3B;color:#fff;border:1.5px solid #95AB3B\" data-hv=\"4\">Search the school directory<svg width=\"16\" height=\"16\" viewBox=\"0 0 24 24\" fill=\"none\" stroke=\"currentColor\" stroke-width=\"2.6\" stroke-linecap=\"round\" stroke-linejoin=\"round\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><path d=\"M5 12h14\"></path><path d=\"m13 6 6 6-6 6\"></path></svg></a><a href=\"/ctec-20-hour-course/\" style=\"display:inline-flex;align-items:center;justify-content:center;gap:8px;font:700 19px Manrope,sans-serif;border-radius:999px;white-space:nowrap;text-decoration:none;cursor:pointer;transition:background .15s,border-color .15s,color .15s;line-height:1.2;padding:14px 28px;background:transparent;color:#fff;border:1.5px solid rgba(255,255,255,.45)\" data-hv=\"5\">20 Hour CTEC Courses</a><a href=\"/ctec-60-hour-course/\" style=\"display:inline-flex;align-items:center;justify-content:center;gap:8px;font:700 19px Manrope,sans-serif;border-radius:999px;white-space:nowrap;text-decoration:none;cursor:pointer;transition:background .15s,border-color .15s,color .15s;line-height:1.2;padding:14px 28px;background:transparent;color:#fff;border:1.5px solid rgba(255,255,255,.45)\" data-hv=\"5\">60 Hour CTEC Courses</a></div></div></div><div style=\"background:#fff;padding:72px 56px\">\n    <div style=\"max-width:1200px;margin:0 auto;display:grid;grid-template-columns:1fr 1fr;gap:56px;align-items:start\">\n      <div style=\"display:flex;flex-direction:column;gap:14px\"><div style=\"font:700 17px Manrope,sans-serif;letter-spacing:.12em;text-transform:uppercase;color:#7E9330\">Ordering</div><h2 style=\"margin:0;font:300 52px/1.1 'Source Serif 4',Georgia,serif;\">No rankings. <span style=\"font-weight:300\">You choose the sort.</span></h2><p style=\"margin:0;font-size:22px;line-height:1.65;color:#2F4652;text-wrap:pretty\">Listings default to alphabetical order. You can sort by published price or filter by course type and verified features. No provider can pay to move up, and we publish no editorial score.</p><p style=\"margin:0;font-size:22px;line-height:1.65;color:#2F4652;text-wrap:pretty\">If we later add ratings or reviews, this page will describe exactly how they are gathered before they appear on the site.</p></div>\n      <div style=\"display:flex;flex-direction:column;gap:14px\"><div style=\"font:700 17px Manrope,sans-serif;letter-spacing:.12em;text-transform:uppercase;color:#7E9330\">Checking</div><h2 style=\"margin:0;font:300 52px/1.1 'Source Serif 4',Georgia,serif;\">What we check, <span style=\"font-weight:300\">and when</span></h2><p style=\"margin:0;font-size:22px;line-height:1.65;color:#2F4652;text-wrap:pretty\">Prices, offers and approval status are reviewed against provider websites and the CTEC registry on each data review. The date of the most recent completed review is shown on the homepage and on this page: <strong style=\"color:#0B2E40\">{{ lastChecked }}</strong>.</p><p style=\"margin:0;font-size:22px;line-height:1.65;color:#2F4652;text-wrap:pretty\">Providers can verify or correct their own listing at no charge through <a href=\"/provider-application/\" style=\"color:#7E9330;font-weight:700\">Verify your profile</a> or <a href=\"/provider-rights/#correction\" style=\"color:#7E9330;font-weight:700\">Request a correction</a>.</p></div>\n    </div>\n  </div>\n  <div style=\"background:#F4F6F7;padding:56px 56px 72px\"><div style=\"max-width:1200px;margin:0 auto;background:#fff;border:1px solid #D7DFE2;border-radius:16px;padding:22px 28px;font-size:19px;line-height:1.6;color:#5A6E78\">Tax Course Finder is an independent comparison website and is not affiliated with CTEC or with any listed provider. Confirm course details and approval on the provider’s site and at <a href=\"https://ctec.org/taxpreparers/find-education-provider/\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener\" style=\"color:#7E9330;font-weight:700\">CTEC.org</a> before enrolling.</div></div>\n  \n</div>\n  <sc-if value=\"{{ subOpen }}\" hint-placeholder-val=\"{{ false }}\">\n  <div style=\"position:fixed;right:24px;bottom:24px;z-index:80;width:380px;max-width:calc(100vw - 32px);background:#fff;border:1px solid #D7DFE2;border-radius:18px;box-shadow:0 30px 70px rgba(11,46,64,.28);overflow:hidden;font-family:'Source Sans 3',sans-serif;color:#0B2E40\">\n    <div style=\"height:5px;background:#95AB3B\"></div>\n    <div onclick=\"{{ subClose }}\" title=\"Close\" style=\"position:absolute;top:14px;right:12px;width:36px;height:36px;display:grid;place-items:center;border-radius:8px;cursor:pointer;color:#5A6E78\" data-hv=\"7\"><svg width=\"18\" height=\"18\" viewBox=\"0 0 24 24\" fill=\"none\" stroke=\"currentColor\" stroke-width=\"2.4\" stroke-linecap=\"round\"><path d=\"M6 6l12 12M18 6L6 18\"></path></svg></div>\n    <div style=\"padding:26px 26px 24px;display:flex;flex-direction:column;gap:14px\">\n      <div style=\"font:700 15px Manrope,sans-serif;letter-spacing:.12em;text-transform:uppercase;color:#7E9330\">Monthly coupon codes</div>\n      <div style=\"font:800 26px/1.15 Manrope,sans-serif;letter-spacing:-.01em;padding-right:24px\">Get CTEC course coupon codes every month</div>\n      <p style=\"margin:0;font-size:17px;line-height:1.5;color:#5A6E78\">New codes from different course providers each month, plus an alert when a sale starts. No spam, unsubscribe anytime.</p>\n      <sc-if value=\"{{ subDone }}\" hint-placeholder-val=\"{{ false }}\"><div style=\"background:#F3F5E6;border:1px solid #D7EDC8;border-radius:10px;padding:14px 16px;font:700 17px Manrope,sans-serif;color:#7E9330\">You're in. Watch for this month's codes.</div></sc-if>\n      <sc-if value=\"{{ subPending }}\" hint-placeholder-val=\"{{ true }}\">\n      <form onsubmit=\"{{ subSubmit }}\" style=\"display:flex;flex-direction:column;gap:10px\">\n        <input type=\"email\" required=\"\" value=\"{{ subEmail }}\" onchange=\"{{ subChange }}\" placeholder=\"you@example.com\" style=\"height:50px;border:1px solid #D7DFE2;border-radius:10px;padding:0 16px;font:400 17px 'Source Sans 3',sans-serif;color:#0B2E40;outline:none;width:100%;box-sizing:border-box\">\n        <button type=\"submit\" style=\"height:50px;border:0;border-radius:10px;background:#95AB3B;color:#fff;font:700 17px Manrope,sans-serif;cursor:pointer\" data-hv=\"6\">Send me the codes</button>\n      </form>\n      </sc-if>\n      <div style=\"font-size:15px;color:#8A9AA3\">By subscribing you agree to our <a href=\"/privacy-policy/\" style=\"color:#7E9330;font-weight:700\">Privacy Policy</a>.</div>\n    </div>\n  </div>\n  </sc-if>\n</template>",
 "css": "body{margin:0;background:#fff;font-family:\"Source Sans 3\",system-ui,sans-serif;color:#0B2E40}a{color:#7E9330;text-decoration:none}a:hover{color:#7E9330}a:visited{color:#7E9330}a:active{color:#7E9330}a:focus{outline:none}html{scrollbar-gutter:stable}button,select{font:inherit}button:focus,select:focus,input:focus{outline:none}.dd-menu a{display:flex!important;align-items:center;justify-content:space-between;gap:18px}.dd .dd-menu{display:none}.dd:hover .dd-menu,.dd:focus-within .dd-menu{display:block}",
 "ssr": "\n\n\n<div data-screen-label=\"How We Compare Providers\" class=\"tcf-screen\">\n  \n\n  <div class=\"tcf-hero-fixed\" style=\"position:relative;overflow:hidden;color:#fff;padding:110px 56px 100px\">\n    <img src=\"/assets/photos/comparing-ctec-courses.webp\" alt=\"\" class=\"tcf-hero-bg\" style=\"position:absolute;inset:0;width:100%;height:100%;object-fit:cover\"><div style=\"position:absolute;inset:0;background:linear-gradient(100deg,rgba(11,46,64,.96) 0%,rgba(11,46,64,.88) 55%,rgba(11,46,64,.78) 100%)\"></div>\n      <div style=\"position:absolute;inset:0;background-image:linear-gradient(135deg,rgba(255,255,255,.07) 0%,rgba(255,255,255,0) 55%);\"></div>\n    <div style=\"position:relative;max-width:1200px;margin:0 auto\"><div style=\"display:flex;flex-direction:column;gap:20px;max-width:820px\">\n      <span style=\"align-self:flex-start;border:1px solid rgba(108,190,69,.5);color:#95AB3B;border-radius:999px;padding:7px 14px;font:700 17px Manrope,sans-serif;letter-spacing:.1em;text-transform:uppercase\">Our method</span>\n      <h1 style=\"margin:0;font:300 52px/1.05 'Source Serif 4',Georgia,serif;\"><span style=\"display:block\">How we</span><span style=\"display:block;font-weight:300\">compare <span style=\"color:#95AB3B\">providers</span></span></h1>\n      <p style=\"margin:0;font-size:22px;line-height:1.55;color:#fff;max-width:640px;text-wrap:pretty\">Tax Course Finder lists every CTEC-approved education provider and shows the same facts for each. We do not score, rank or recommend schools. The order you see is the sort you choose.</p>\n    </div></div>\n  </div>\n  <div style=\"height:6px;background:linear-gradient(90deg,#95AB3B,#7E9330)\"></div>\n  <div style=\"background:#F4F6F7;padding:72px 56px\">\n    <div style=\"max-width:1200px;margin:0 auto;display:flex;flex-direction:column;gap:28px\">\n      <div style=\"max-width:820px\"><div style=\"font:700 17px Manrope,sans-serif;letter-spacing:.12em;text-transform:uppercase;color:#7E9330\">What is on every listing</div><h2 style=\"margin:10px 0 0;font:300 52px/1.1 'Source Serif 4',Georgia,serif;\">The same facts, <span style=\"font-weight:300\">the same way</span></h2><p style=\"margin:0;font-size:22px;line-height:1.65;color:#2F4652;text-wrap:pretty;margin-top:14px\">Each provider row shows the details below when we have verified them. A blank field means we have not confirmed it yet; it does not mean the provider lacks the feature.</p></div>\n      <style>.tcf-fact{transition:transform .18s ease,box-shadow .18s ease,border-color .18s ease}.tcf-fact::before{content:\"\";position:absolute;left:0;top:0;right:0;height:3px;background:#95AB3B;transform:scaleX(0);transform-origin:left;transition:transform .25s ease}.tcf-fact:hover{transform:translateY(-3px);box-shadow:0 18px 40px rgba(11,46,64,.10);border-color:#C9D58F!important}.tcf-fact:hover::before{transform:scaleX(1)}</style><div style=\"display:grid;grid-template-columns:1fr 1fr 1fr;gap:18px\"><div class=\"tcf-fact\" style=\"position:relative;background:#fff;border:1px solid #D7DFE2;border-radius:18px;padding:28px 28px 24px;display:flex;flex-direction:column;gap:14px;overflow:hidden\"><div style=\"display:flex;align-items:center;justify-content:space-between;gap:12px\"><div style=\"width:52px;height:52px;border-radius:14px;background:#F3F5E6;display:grid;place-items:center;flex:none\"><svg width=\"26\" height=\"26\" viewBox=\"0 0 24 24\" fill=\"none\" stroke=\"#7E9330\" stroke-width=\"1.9\" stroke-linecap=\"round\" stroke-linejoin=\"round\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><path d=\"M12 3l8 3v6c0 5-3.5 8-8 9-4.5-1-8-4-8-9V6l8-3z\"></path><path d=\"m9 12 2 2 4-4\"></path></svg></div><span style=\"font:700 13px Manrope,sans-serif;letter-spacing:.12em;color:#B5BECB\">01</span></div><h3 style=\"margin:4px 0 0;font:800 22px Manrope,sans-serif;color:#0B2E40\">CTEC approval</h3><p style=\"margin:0;font-size:19px;line-height:1.6;color:#2F4652;flex:1\">Every school is matched to CTEC’s approved-provider registry before it appears, with the course types (20-hour CE, 60-hour QE) its approval covers.</p><div style=\"margin-top:6px;padding-top:16px;border-top:1px dashed #D7DFE2;display:flex;flex-direction:column;gap:10px\"><span style=\"font:700 12px Manrope,sans-serif;letter-spacing:.1em;text-transform:uppercase;color:#8A9AA3\">On the listing</span><div style=\"display:flex;flex-wrap:wrap;align-items:center;gap:8px 10px\"><span style=\"font:700 16px Manrope,sans-serif;color:#0B2E40\">CE · QE</span><span style=\"font:700 12px Manrope,sans-serif;letter-spacing:.1em;text-transform:uppercase;color:#8A9AA3\">CTEC approved</span></div></div></div><div class=\"tcf-fact\" style=\"position:relative;background:#fff;border:1px solid #D7DFE2;border-radius:18px;padding:28px 28px 24px;display:flex;flex-direction:column;gap:14px;overflow:hidden\"><div style=\"display:flex;align-items:center;justify-content:space-between;gap:12px\"><div style=\"width:52px;height:52px;border-radius:14px;background:#F3F5E6;display:grid;place-items:center;flex:none\"><svg width=\"26\" height=\"26\" viewBox=\"0 0 24 24\" fill=\"none\" stroke=\"#7E9330\" stroke-width=\"1.9\" stroke-linecap=\"round\" stroke-linejoin=\"round\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><path d=\"M3 12V4a1 1 0 0 1 1-1h8l9 9-9 9-9-9z\"></path><circle cx=\"7.5\" cy=\"7.5\" r=\"1.5\"></circle></svg></div><span style=\"font:700 13px Manrope,sans-serif;letter-spacing:.12em;color:#B5BECB\">02</span></div><h3 style=\"margin:4px 0 0;font:800 22px Manrope,sans-serif;color:#0B2E40\">Course bundle price</h3><p style=\"margin:0;font-size:19px;line-height:1.6;color:#2F4652;flex:1\">The price on the provider’s own website for the complete course. If a school publishes no flat price, the row says so instead of estimating.</p><div style=\"margin-top:6px;padding-top:16px;border-top:1px dashed #D7DFE2;display:flex;flex-direction:column;gap:10px\"><span style=\"font:700 12px Manrope,sans-serif;letter-spacing:.1em;text-transform:uppercase;color:#8A9AA3\">On the listing</span><div style=\"display:flex;flex-wrap:wrap;align-items:center;gap:8px 10px\"><span style=\"font:700 20px Manrope,sans-serif;color:#0B2E40;font-variant-numeric:tabular-nums\">$49.95</span><span style=\"font:700 12px Manrope,sans-serif;letter-spacing:.1em;text-transform:uppercase;color:#8A9AA3\">Course bundle price</span></div></div></div><div class=\"tcf-fact\" style=\"position:relative;background:#fff;border:1px solid #D7DFE2;border-radius:18px;padding:28px 28px 24px;display:flex;flex-direction:column;gap:14px;overflow:hidden\"><div style=\"display:flex;align-items:center;justify-content:space-between;gap:12px\"><div style=\"width:52px;height:52px;border-radius:14px;background:#F3F5E6;display:grid;place-items:center;flex:none\"><svg width=\"26\" height=\"26\" viewBox=\"0 0 24 24\" fill=\"none\" stroke=\"#7E9330\" stroke-width=\"1.9\" stroke-linecap=\"round\" stroke-linejoin=\"round\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><path d=\"M19 5 5 19\"></path><circle cx=\"7\" cy=\"7\" r=\"2.5\"></circle><circle cx=\"17\" cy=\"17\" r=\"2.5\"></circle></svg></div><span style=\"font:700 13px Manrope,sans-serif;letter-spacing:.12em;color:#B5BECB\">03</span></div><h3 style=\"margin:4px 0 0;font:800 22px Manrope,sans-serif;color:#0B2E40\">Current offers</h3><p style=\"margin:0;font-size:19px;line-height:1.6;color:#2F4652;flex:1\">Coupon codes and sales are recorded only when found on the provider’s site or supplied by the provider, with the date checked. Expired offers are removed.</p><div style=\"margin-top:6px;padding-top:16px;border-top:1px dashed #D7DFE2;display:flex;flex-direction:column;gap:10px\"><span style=\"font:700 12px Manrope,sans-serif;letter-spacing:.1em;text-transform:uppercase;color:#8A9AA3\">On the listing</span><div style=\"display:flex;flex-wrap:wrap;align-items:center;gap:8px 10px\"><span style=\"font:700 15px ui-monospace,Menlo,monospace;color:#7E9330;background:#F3F5E6;border:1.5px dashed #95AB3B;border-radius:6px;padding:4px 9px\">SAVE10</span><span style=\"font:700 12px Manrope,sans-serif;letter-spacing:.1em;text-transform:uppercase;color:#8A9AA3\">Coupon code</span></div></div></div><div class=\"tcf-fact\" style=\"position:relative;background:#fff;border:1px solid #D7DFE2;border-radius:18px;padding:28px 28px 24px;display:flex;flex-direction:column;gap:14px;overflow:hidden\"><div style=\"display:flex;align-items:center;justify-content:space-between;gap:12px\"><div style=\"width:52px;height:52px;border-radius:14px;background:#F3F5E6;display:grid;place-items:center;flex:none\"><svg width=\"26\" height=\"26\" viewBox=\"0 0 24 24\" fill=\"none\" stroke=\"#7E9330\" stroke-width=\"1.9\" stroke-linecap=\"round\" stroke-linejoin=\"round\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><rect x=\"3\" y=\"4\" width=\"18\" height=\"12\" rx=\"2\"></rect><path d=\"M8 20h8M12 16v4\"></path><path d=\"m10.5 8 3.5 2-3.5 2z\"></path></svg></div><span style=\"font:700 13px Manrope,sans-serif;letter-spacing:.12em;color:#B5BECB\">04</span></div><h3 style=\"margin:4px 0 0;font:800 22px Manrope,sans-serif;color:#0B2E40\">Course format</h3><p style=\"margin:0;font-size:19px;line-height:1.6;color:#2F4652;flex:1\">Online, in-person and live classes, plus printed books, PDFs and online videos, shown once confirmed by the provider or our review.</p><div style=\"margin-top:6px;padding-top:16px;border-top:1px dashed #D7DFE2;display:flex;flex-direction:column;gap:10px\"><span style=\"font:700 12px Manrope,sans-serif;letter-spacing:.1em;text-transform:uppercase;color:#8A9AA3\">On the listing</span><div style=\"display:flex;flex-wrap:wrap;align-items:center;gap:8px 10px\"><span style=\"font:600 14px/1 Manrope,sans-serif;padding:6px 11px;border-radius:999px;border:1px solid #D7DFE2;background:#fff;color:#2F4652;white-space:nowrap\">Online</span><span style=\"font:600 14px/1 Manrope,sans-serif;padding:6px 11px;border-radius:999px;border:1px solid #D7DFE2;background:#fff;color:#2F4652;white-space:nowrap\">PDF</span><span style=\"font:600 14px/1 Manrope,sans-serif;padding:6px 11px;border-radius:999px;border:1px solid #D7DFE2;background:#fff;color:#2F4652;white-space:nowrap\">Online videos</span></div></div></div><div class=\"tcf-fact\" style=\"position:relative;background:#fff;border:1px solid #D7DFE2;border-radius:18px;padding:28px 28px 24px;display:flex;flex-direction:column;gap:14px;overflow:hidden\"><div style=\"display:flex;align-items:center;justify-content:space-between;gap:12px\"><div style=\"width:52px;height:52px;border-radius:14px;background:#F3F5E6;display:grid;place-items:center;flex:none\"><svg width=\"26\" height=\"26\" viewBox=\"0 0 24 24\" fill=\"none\" stroke=\"#7E9330\" stroke-width=\"1.9\" stroke-linecap=\"round\" stroke-linejoin=\"round\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><path d=\"M4 14v-2a8 8 0 0 1 16 0v2\"></path><rect x=\"3\" y=\"14\" width=\"4\" height=\"6\" rx=\"1.5\"></rect><rect x=\"17\" y=\"14\" width=\"4\" height=\"6\" rx=\"1.5\"></rect></svg></div><span style=\"font:700 13px Manrope,sans-serif;letter-spacing:.12em;color:#B5BECB\">05</span></div><h3 style=\"margin:4px 0 0;font:800 22px Manrope,sans-serif;color:#0B2E40\">Student support</h3><p style=\"margin:0;font-size:19px;line-height:1.6;color:#2F4652;flex:1\">Phone, email and live chat support, shown only when verified, so you know how to get help before you enroll.</p><div style=\"margin-top:6px;padding-top:16px;border-top:1px dashed #D7DFE2;display:flex;flex-direction:column;gap:10px\"><span style=\"font:700 12px Manrope,sans-serif;letter-spacing:.1em;text-transform:uppercase;color:#8A9AA3\">On the listing</span><div style=\"display:flex;flex-wrap:wrap;align-items:center;gap:8px 10px\"><span style=\"font:600 14px/1 Manrope,sans-serif;padding:6px 11px;border-radius:999px;border:1px solid #D7DFE2;background:#fff;color:#2F4652;white-space:nowrap\">Phone support</span><span style=\"font:600 14px/1 Manrope,sans-serif;padding:6px 11px;border-radius:999px;border:1px solid #D7DFE2;background:#fff;color:#2F4652;white-space:nowrap\">Email support</span><span style=\"font:600 14px/1 Manrope,sans-serif;padding:6px 11px;border-radius:999px;border:1px solid #D7DFE2;background:#fff;color:#2F4652;white-space:nowrap\">Live chat</span></div></div></div><div class=\"tcf-fact\" style=\"position:relative;background:#fff;border:1px solid #D7DFE2;border-radius:18px;padding:28px 28px 24px;display:flex;flex-direction:column;gap:14px;overflow:hidden\"><div style=\"display:flex;align-items:center;justify-content:space-between;gap:12px\"><div style=\"width:52px;height:52px;border-radius:14px;background:#F3F5E6;display:grid;place-items:center;flex:none\"><svg width=\"26\" height=\"26\" viewBox=\"0 0 24 24\" fill=\"none\" stroke=\"#7E9330\" stroke-width=\"1.9\" stroke-linecap=\"round\" stroke-linejoin=\"round\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><path d=\"M14 4h6v6\"></path><path d=\"M20 4 11 13\"></path><path d=\"M19 14v5a1 1 0 0 1-1 1H5a1 1 0 0 1-1-1V6a1 1 0 0 1 1-1h5\"></path></svg></div><span style=\"font:700 13px Manrope,sans-serif;letter-spacing:.12em;color:#B5BECB\">06</span></div><h3 style=\"margin:4px 0 0;font:800 22px Manrope,sans-serif;color:#0B2E40\">Website link</h3><p style=\"margin:0;font-size:19px;line-height:1.6;color:#2F4652;flex:1\">A direct link to the provider’s course page. You enroll with the school, not with us.</p><div style=\"margin-top:6px;padding-top:16px;border-top:1px dashed #D7DFE2;display:flex;flex-direction:column;gap:10px\"><span style=\"font:700 12px Manrope,sans-serif;letter-spacing:.1em;text-transform:uppercase;color:#8A9AA3\">On the listing</span><div style=\"display:flex;flex-wrap:wrap;align-items:center;gap:8px 10px\"><span style=\"display:inline-flex;align-items:center;gap:6px;font:700 15px Manrope,sans-serif;background:#95AB3B;color:#fff;border-radius:999px;padding:8px 16px\">View course<svg width=\"13\" height=\"13\" viewBox=\"0 0 24 24\" fill=\"none\" stroke=\"currentColor\" stroke-width=\"2.8\" stroke-linecap=\"round\" stroke-linejoin=\"round\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><path d=\"M5 12h14\"></path><path d=\"m13 6 6 6-6 6\"></path></svg></span></div></div></div></div>\n    </div>\n  </div>\n  <div class=\"tcf-cta\" style=\"background:#0B2E40;padding:64px 56px;color:#fff\"><div style=\"max-width:1200px;margin:0 auto;display:flex;flex-wrap:wrap;align-items:center;justify-content:space-between;gap:28px 48px\"><div style=\"flex:1 1 520px;display:flex;flex-direction:column;gap:12px\"><div style=\"display:flex;align-items:center;gap:12px;font:700 17px Manrope,sans-serif;letter-spacing:.14em;text-transform:uppercase;color:#AEC25A\"><span style=\"width:28px;height:2px;background:#95AB3B\"></span>Find your course</div><h2 style=\"margin:0;font:300 44px/1.1 'Source Serif 4',Georgia,serif;text-wrap:balance\">Search our directory of CTEC-approved schools</h2><p style=\"margin:0;font-size:20px;line-height:1.6;color:rgba(255,255,255,.78);max-width:640px\">See every provider side by side: prices, current coupons, course format and support. Then go straight to the school’s course page.</p></div><div style=\"display:flex;flex-wrap:wrap;gap:12px;flex:0 1 auto\"><a href=\"/#find-schools\" style=\"display:inline-flex;align-items:center;justify-content:center;gap:8px;font:700 19px Manrope,sans-serif;border-radius:999px;white-space:nowrap;text-decoration:none;cursor:pointer;transition:background .15s,border-color .15s,color .15s;line-height:1.2;padding:14px 28px;background:#95AB3B;color:#fff;border:1.5px solid #95AB3B\" data-hv=\"4\">Search the school directory<svg width=\"16\" height=\"16\" viewBox=\"0 0 24 24\" fill=\"none\" stroke=\"currentColor\" stroke-width=\"2.6\" stroke-linecap=\"round\" stroke-linejoin=\"round\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><path d=\"M5 12h14\"></path><path d=\"m13 6 6 6-6 6\"></path></svg></a><a href=\"/ctec-20-hour-course/\" style=\"display:inline-flex;align-items:center;justify-content:center;gap:8px;font:700 19px Manrope,sans-serif;border-radius:999px;white-space:nowrap;text-decoration:none;cursor:pointer;transition:background .15s,border-color .15s,color .15s;line-height:1.2;padding:14px 28px;background:transparent;color:#fff;border:1.5px solid rgba(255,255,255,.45)\" data-hv=\"5\">20 Hour CTEC Courses</a><a href=\"/ctec-60-hour-course/\" style=\"display:inline-flex;align-items:center;justify-content:center;gap:8px;font:700 19px Manrope,sans-serif;border-radius:999px;white-space:nowrap;text-decoration:none;cursor:pointer;transition:background .15s,border-color .15s,color .15s;line-height:1.2;padding:14px 28px;background:transparent;color:#fff;border:1.5px solid rgba(255,255,255,.45)\" data-hv=\"5\">60 Hour CTEC Courses</a></div></div></div><div style=\"background:#fff;padding:72px 56px\">\n    <div style=\"max-width:1200px;margin:0 auto;display:grid;grid-template-columns:1fr 1fr;gap:56px;align-items:start\">\n      <div style=\"display:flex;flex-direction:column;gap:14px\"><div style=\"font:700 17px Manrope,sans-serif;letter-spacing:.12em;text-transform:uppercase;color:#7E9330\">Ordering</div><h2 style=\"margin:0;font:300 52px/1.1 'Source Serif 4',Georgia,serif;\">No rankings. <span style=\"font-weight:300\">You choose the sort.</span></h2><p style=\"margin:0;font-size:22px;line-height:1.65;color:#2F4652;text-wrap:pretty\">Listings default to alphabetical order. You can sort by published price or filter by course type and verified features. No provider can pay to move up, and we publish no editorial score.</p><p style=\"margin:0;font-size:22px;line-height:1.65;color:#2F4652;text-wrap:pretty\">If we later add ratings or reviews, this page will describe exactly how they are gathered before they appear on the site.</p></div>\n      <div style=\"display:flex;flex-direction:column;gap:14px\"><div style=\"font:700 17px Manrope,sans-serif;letter-spacing:.12em;text-transform:uppercase;color:#7E9330\">Checking</div><h2 style=\"margin:0;font:300 52px/1.1 'Source Serif 4',Georgia,serif;\">What we check, <span style=\"font-weight:300\">and when</span></h2><p style=\"margin:0;font-size:22px;line-height:1.65;color:#2F4652;text-wrap:pretty\">Prices, offers and approval status are reviewed against provider websites and the CTEC registry on each data review. The date of the most recent completed review is shown on the homepage and on this page: <strong style=\"color:#0B2E40\">October 12, 2026</strong>.</p><p style=\"margin:0;font-size:22px;line-height:1.65;color:#2F4652;text-wrap:pretty\">Providers can verify or correct their own listing at no charge through <a href=\"/provider-application/\" style=\"color:#7E9330;font-weight:700\">Verify your profile</a> or <a href=\"/provider-rights/#correction\" style=\"color:#7E9330;font-weight:700\">Request a correction</a>.</p></div>\n    </div>\n  </div>\n  <div style=\"background:#F4F6F7;padding:56px 56px 72px\"><div style=\"max-width:1200px;margin:0 auto;background:#fff;border:1px solid #D7DFE2;border-radius:16px;padding:22px 28px;font-size:19px;line-height:1.6;color:#5A6E78\">Tax Course Finder is an independent comparison website and is not affiliated with CTEC or with any listed provider. Confirm course details and approval on the provider’s site and at <a href=\"https://ctec.org/taxpreparers/find-education-provider/\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener\" style=\"color:#7E9330;font-weight:700\">CTEC.org</a> before enrolling.</div></div>\n  \n</div>\n  \n"
